<html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Client Agreement</title></head>
<body style="font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.5">
<h1>Content Services Client Agreement</h1>
<p>This Agreement is made on ____________________ (the "Start Date") between:</p>
<p><b>Agency:</b> ______________________________ ("Agency")<br><b>Client:</b> ______________________________ ("Client")</p>
<h2>1. Services</h2>
<p>The Agency will build and manage an in-house content team for the Client, including video editing, thumbnail design, content strategy and channel management as described in the selected plan.</p>
<h2>2. Plan</h2>
<p>[ ] Team Only &nbsp;&nbsp; [ ] Personal Involved &nbsp;&nbsp; [ ] Custom: ______________________</p>
<h2>3. Fees</h2>
<p>Setup fee: $______________ due on signing.<br>Monthly fee: $______________ due on the ______ day of each month.</p>
<h2>4. Client responsibilities</h2>
<p>The Client will supply raw footage on the agreed schedule, provide access to the accounts needed for uploading and publishing, and give timely feedback.</p>
<h2>5. Ownership</h2>
<p>On payment, all final content produced under this Agreement belongs to the Client.</p>
<h2>6. Term and cancellation</h2>
<p>This Agreement starts on the Start Date and continues month to month. Either party may end it with ______ days' written notice.</p>
<h2>7. Confidentiality</h2>
<p>Both parties will keep each other's non-public business information confidential.</p>
<br><br>
<p>Agency signature: ______________________________ &nbsp; Date: ______________</p>
<p>Client signature: ______________________________ &nbsp; Date: ______________</p>
</body></html>
